/E (This project highlights how SQL can drive data-informed decisions in a retail setting by analyzing over half million rows of sales and warranty data. Key insights include identifying top-selling products, tracking seasonal and regional sales trends, evaluating product quality through warranty claims, and assessing customer satisfaction based on service metrics. These findings support strategic improvements in sales, inventory management, product development, and customer service, ultimately boosting profitability and customer loyalty.)
